Subject: [PATCH] Wire the password manager UI into the Android build

Add the restored password manager sources to the Java/GNI/BUILD graphs, point
the settings 'Passwords' entry at PasswordSettings, open the local settings
from PasswordManagerHelper, and add the required strings and dimensions.

